# sigrok/tests/mpu9255/

This directory is reserved for a captured sigrok session file (`.sr`)
used to manually verify the `mpu9255` sigrok protocol decoder. PulseView
opens the `.sr` file and confirms the annotations match the register
values shown in the capture.

No session file is committed yet. The conformance checker
(`conformance/imu/mpu9255_conformance.py`) is the automated path that
verifies the timing constraint defined in `specs/imu/mpu9255_timing.conf`.